@startuml
title Plugin QR enablement per tenant
actor "Tenant admin A" as Admin
participant "Core API" as API
database "Tenant A DB" as DB
participant "QR plugin process" as QR
Admin -> API : POST enable QR (HTTPS)
API -> DB : set enabled=true (SQL commit)
API --> Admin : 200 enabled
Admin -> API : POST attendance QR (HTTPS)
API -> DB : verify enabled + enrollment
API -> QR : HTTP JSON tenant-scoped, timeout 500ms
QR --> API : attendance result
API -> DB : persist attendance
API --> Admin : 200
note bottom
  Tenant B registry remains disabled.
  QR process has no database credential; timeout returns 503
  for QR only and does not block exam submissions.
end note
@enduml
